    },
    "cargo_lock": {
      "comment": [
        "Narrowed to the dependency closure of the one package that",
        "produces a shipped artifact: uuav-server (the uuav-helper child",
        "process). uuav-core and uuav-ipc are path dependencies of it and",
        "enter the closure through it. uuav-client ships nothing from here:",
        "the host compiles it from the same source, whose digest",
        "client_source pins. A dependency added to something that ships",
        "nothing must not demand a three-platform rebuild of byte-identical",
        "binaries."
